          "exampleId": "w:area#e-666a9285c950ceeb",
          "text": "Tour highlights include the Roman city of Dougga, the underground Numidian capital at Bulla Regia, Roman Sbeitla and the remote areas around Tataouine and Matmata, unique for underground cities.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2020-national-iii",
