            "start": 70,
            "end": 74
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:area#e-4cb56eb9c9bfd780",
          "text": "Previous studies have shown that exercise can help stimulate the areas of the brain that convert (转换) new information into long-term memory.",
          "source": {
