          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 131,
            "end": 135
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:area#e-a95ac2b72484f53a",
          "text": "She is confident that small land areas can bring large returns if farmers are able to adapt by planting sustainable crops, using new technologies for water treatment and focusing on natural products and fertilisers (肥料) rather than chemicals.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2023-four-provinces-feb",
